      "manifestNotes": "The gateway system's first stage (architecture 1, 10). The gateway proxy names the explicitly configured GATEWAY_UPGRADE_TIMELOCK (nonzero, with code) as its upgrade authority. It never defaults to the vaults timelock, which is not an input of this system. The deployer holds the gateway roles until the gateway-handover stage."
